        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Schlage B60CEN, Single Cylinder Century Deadbolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe unique design of Schlage's Century Single Cylinder Deadbolt is perfect for even the most modern home. The sleek, slightly curved rose has concealed screws. It fits standard door cutouts and has an adjustable backset for 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\". It is adjustable for 1-3/8\" up to 1-3/4\" door thicknesses. The modern look of this single cylinder deadbolt makes it the perfect addition to any contemporary space.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder Deadbolt:</b> Deadbolt thrown or retracted by key from the outside and by turn unit on the inside. Bolt automatically deadlocks when fully thrown.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available <a href=\"/products/extra-thick-door-rectangular-deadbolt-db60cen-61073\"><b>Century Deadbolt for 2-1/4\" - 4\" thick doors</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Modern Single Cylinder Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Door frame strike reinforced with 3\" screws for extra security.</li>\r\n<li>ANSI A156.5, 2001, Grade 1 auxiliary lock.</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with two keys.</li>\r\n<li>1\" deadbolt with hardened steel core.</li>\r\n<li>Has an anti-pick shield around the cylinder</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass cylinder and trim.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Single Cylinder Deadbolt with Century Trim:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Height: 4-5/32\" (4.15\")</li>\r\n<li>Width: 2-27/32\" (2.84\")</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable for 1-3/8\" up to 1-3/4\" thick doors</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable Backset for 2-3/8” or 2-3/4”</li>\r\n<li>Strike: 1-1/8” x 2-3/4”, 1/4” radius corner</li>\r\n<li>Cylinder: 5-pin, C Keyway</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Century Single Cylinder Deadbolt, Schlage B60CEN",
                "description": "Schlage B60CEN, Century Single Cylinder Deadbolt - The unique design of Schlage's Century Single Cylinder Deadbolt is perfect for even the most modern home. The sleek, slightly curved rose has concealed screws. It fits standard door cutouts and has an adjustable backset for 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches. It is adjustable for 1-3/8 inch up to 1-3/4 inch door thicknesses. The modern look of this single cylinder deadbolt makes it the perfect addition to any contemporary space.\r\n",
